WEBVTT

00:00:02.430 --> 00:00:04.340
Within the ever-expanding universe...

00:00:05.530 --> 00:00:11.290
Fumizuki Academy is a prep school with the goal of rallying its students to victory in exam battles.

00:00:11.290 --> 00:00:15.280
One could consider it a breeding ground for
warriors who use test scores as their weapons.

00:00:16.030 --> 00:00:18.510
With the dignity of their class at stake,

00:00:18.510 --> 00:00:20.540
these warriors do battle with the subjects they excel at

00:00:20.540 --> 00:00:23.660
in order to capture the enemy classes' strategic forts.

00:00:24.250 --> 00:00:26.750
Those who are capable shall be crowned as victors

00:00:26.750 --> 00:00:29.750
and live an elegant and praise-worthy school life.

00:00:29.750 --> 00:00:35.920
Those who are not shall fall into the pits of hell and live out a tragic tale.

00:00:37.110 --> 00:00:42.850
This is a story about the exam warriors who dare to oppose their cruel fate.

00:00:42.850 --> 00:00:48.880
And here one can discover the consequences of losing an Exam Summoning Battle.

00:00:50.400 --> 00:00:53.390
They have student discounts,
but a ticket still costs 1000 yen...

00:00:53.390 --> 00:00:55.560
A medium coke costs 300 yen...

00:00:55.560 --> 00:00:58.040
A small popcorn costs 400 yen...

00:00:58.040 --> 00:01:00.940
I'm going to spend that much in only two hours?

00:01:00.940 --> 00:01:03.620
Movie theaters are horrible places!

00:01:03.620 --> 00:01:05.710
Yoshii...

00:01:05.710 --> 00:01:07.290
What is it, Himeji?

00:01:07.520 --> 00:01:09.360
Want to watch that?

00:01:09.360 --> 00:01:10.710
That looks good.

00:01:10.710 --> 00:01:12.120
Let's watch this, Aki.

00:01:12.380 --> 00:01:14.420
Oh, really...

00:01:14.420 --> 00:01:17.040
I'll pass. You two can watch it by yourselves.

00:01:18.010 --> 00:01:19.210
Why!?
Why?

00:01:19.360 --> 00:01:20.790
How about a cartoon, then?

00:01:20.790 --> 00:01:22.470
That's not what I meant!

00:01:22.470 --> 00:01:24.630
Resistance is futile, Akihisa.

00:01:25.880 --> 00:01:28.590
Men are inferior creatures.

00:01:29.480 --> 00:01:30.640
Yuuji?

00:01:30.640 --> 00:01:32.800
Yuuji, what do you want to watch?

00:01:32.800 --> 00:01:34.080
I just want to get this over with.

00:01:34.080 --> 00:01:36.640
How about Apocalypse Hell: Director's Cut?

00:01:36.640 --> 00:01:39.380
Hold on! That's over three hours long!

00:01:39.380 --> 00:01:40.060
Twice.

00:01:40.060 --> 00:01:42.620
That's longer than an entire day of classes!

00:01:42.620 --> 00:01:47.070
It will make up for the time I can't see you at school.

00:01:48.340 --> 00:01:49.040
I'm leaving.

00:01:49.040 --> 00:01:51.260
I don't think so.

00:01:52.710 --> 00:01:56.550
What the hell, Shouko!? What is tha- That's danger- Shou-!

00:01:56.980 --> 00:01:58.710
Two student tickets for two runs.

00:01:58.710 --> 00:02:02.150
Okay. One student ticket and one unconscious student ticket for two runs, correct?

00:02:02.150 --> 00:02:04.150
What a nice couple!

00:02:04.150 --> 00:02:05.860
I wish I had a guy like that...

00:02:12.570 --> 00:02:17.780
Something that grows when its alone, What is it?

00:02:17.780 --> 00:02:19.060
One more chance, One more chance!

00:02:19.060 --> 00:02:20.440
Never, Never give up!

00:02:20.440 --> 00:02:21.740
One more chance, One more chance!

00:02:21.740 --> 00:02:23.040
Never give up!

00:02:33.530 --> 00:02:36.170
Meeting with someone else is easy

00:02:36.170 --> 00:02:38.940
I decided what to say before they even asked

00:02:38.940 --> 00:02:41.550
My heart beats fast thinking if I passed or not

00:02:41.550 --> 00:02:43.730
I can't panic in this fight for love

00:02:44.160 --> 00:02:46.800
Study! Study! Study! Keeps me up all night

00:02:46.800 --> 00:02:49.430
I've got a dreaming genius inside me

00:02:49.430 --> 00:02:52.010
I'd be great if everyone's wishes came true

00:02:52.010 --> 00:02:54.180
I won't care about other people's lives

00:02:54.530 --> 00:02:57.140
Perfect-area complete!

00:02:57.140 --> 00:02:59.770
I'll definitely be waiting for you!

00:02:59.770 --> 00:03:06.170
I can hear your voice from the Perfect-area!

00:03:06.170 --> 00:03:07.480
Ah! Ear! Ear!

00:03:07.480 --> 00:03:10.750
Why? Why can't stop when I pass you

00:03:10.750 --> 00:03:13.360
if I'm your counselor

00:03:13.360 --> 00:03:15.950
"Are we friends?" Yes, we're friends."

00:03:15.950 --> 00:03:17.950
But, I failed the test with a 0

00:03:17.950 --> 00:03:21.260
No! I'll take it again! and again!

00:03:21.260 --> 00:03:23.400
I'm serious. One more chance, please

00:03:23.400 --> 00:03:27.870
There's something better for is in the future

00:03:28.600 --> 00:03:33.960
Better than my life right now.

00:03:37.130 --> 00:03:37.490
Third Period
Food Expenses and Dates and Stun Guns

00:03:37.490 --> 00:03:41.190
Akihisa Yoshii. His parents are currently working overseas.

00:03:41.190 --> 00:03:43.610
His sister is also studying overseas.

00:03:43.610 --> 00:03:43.630
Third Period
Food Expenses and Dates and Stun Guns

00:03:44.090 --> 00:03:47.630
Thus, he's been enjoying a life filled with freedom.

00:03:47.630 --> 00:03:49.960
I guess I'll have...

00:03:51.600 --> 00:03:54.380
a light breakfast! Gotta save the better stuff for dinner.

00:03:55.350 --> 00:03:59.580
I'll have the smaller one for breakfast and the bigger one for dinner.

00:03:59.930 --> 00:04:01.460
Every minute of it!

00:04:10.850 --> 00:04:12.770
G'morning, Mr. Fukuhara.

00:04:13.650 --> 00:04:15.180
Good morning.

00:04:37.490 --> 00:04:38.980
Ow...

00:04:42.220 --> 00:04:44.270
Aren't you Yoshii from class F?

00:04:45.270 --> 00:04:47.420
Oh yeah, weren't you Kubo from class A?

00:04:47.420 --> 00:04:50.850
That's me. I'm Toshimitsu Kubo, class rank 2.

00:04:51.190 --> 00:04:53.370
Oh dear. I won't have a chance to review before class if I don't hurry up.

00:04:53.370 --> 00:04:54.530
Lecture
Daydream
