00:05:23.350 --> 00:05:24.400
Why!?

00:05:24.680 --> 00:05:26.380
You have problems, man!

00:05:26.380 --> 00:05:26.530
People are watching...

00:05:26.530 --> 00:05:29.260
Thick and stiff
trash

00:05:29.260 --> 00:05:31.020
Yeah, you're right...

00:05:31.020 --> 00:05:31.160
Thick and stiff
