trash

00:05:45.740 --> 00:05:48.070
Oh, I stepped on something.

00:05:48.070 --> 00:05:51.540
Yeah, you just stepped on my lifeline...

00:05:57.070 --> 00:05:58.750
G'morning, Himeji.

00:05:59.350 --> 00:06:02.960
Good morning, Yoshii!

00:06:07.880 --> 00:06:11.210
That's really a love letter for Yuuji, huh?

00:06:11.710 --> 00:06:13.550
But Kirishima already claimed him...

00:06:14.910 --> 00:06:16.790
You're here early, Akihisa.

00:06:17.770 --> 00:06:18.830
How'd it go yesterday?

00:06:18.830 --> 00:06:22.880
My food budget for the month disappeared into the abyss of the movie theater in the blink of an eye...

00:06:22.880 --> 00:06:23.490
What about you?

00:06:23.490 --> 00:06:27.490
When I regained consciousness, I saw a bound cow being slaughtered.

00:06:28.520 --> 00:06:30.110
I wanted to take the chance to escape...

00:06:30.770 --> 00:06:33.120
But I got shocked and lost consciousness again.

00:06:33.590 --> 00:06:35.120
And when I woke up, the cow was there again...

00:06:36.330 --> 00:06:37.660
Wow, you actually did watch it twice.

00:06:37.660 --> 00:06:40.640
If I tried to run away, I'd get another shock...

00:06:40.640 --> 00:06:45.030
The thought of waking up and seeing the cow getting killed again and again was so terrifying I shit my pants!

00:06:45.030 --> 00:06:45.960
So I stopped trying to escape.

00:06:46.390 --> 00:06:48.640
You'll never get to see the beginning of the movie.

00:06:49.580 --> 00:06:53.470
Well, whatever. How am I supposed to subsist until I get my allowance?

00:06:53.850 --> 00:06:55.980
Just sell your game collection.

00:06:55.980 --> 00:06:57.280
Dude, what?

00:06:57.280 --> 00:07:00.160
They're works of art! There's no substitute for them!

00:07:00.160 --> 00:07:02.350
There's no way in hell I'd trade them for food!

00:07:02.350 --> 00:07:05.120
Have you ever heard the phrase "you reap what you sow"?

00:07:05.120 --> 00:07:07.710
Yeah, sure, you can say that. You've got plenty of cash.

00:07:07.710 --> 00:07:08.870
It's a matter of life and death for me!

00:07:09.910 --> 00:07:15.020
Akihisa, do you really think my life isn't in danger?

00:07:19.270 --> 00:07:20.120
Sorry...

00:07:21.000 --> 00:07:21.930
Don't worry.

00:07:24.480 --> 00:07:28.860
I never thought our facilities could get even worse.

00:07:28.860 --> 00:07:30.500
And it's all because of...

00:07:30.760 --> 00:07:31.960
You! You bastard!

00:07:31.960 --> 00:07:36.310
Damn, how bitchy can you get? We gave it all we had, right?

00:07:36.310 --> 00:07:37.810
Except you're the one who lost!

00:07:37.810 --> 00:07:39.190
What's your problem, Aki?

00:07:40.210 --> 00:07:42.520
You're not one to be talking here.

00:07:42.520 --> 00:07:45.030
Neither of us were any help at all.

00:07:46.120 --> 00:07:47.400
I guess.

00:07:47.400 --> 00:07:52.160
Yeah, mistress, Hideyoshi's sister beat the
crap out of you because you're too simple-

00:07:52.160 --> 00:07:52.520
"Mistress"? Are you making fun of me?

00:07:52.520 --> 00:07:56.120
Owowowowowow! You told me to call you that!

00:07:56.120 --> 00:07:57.370
Just call me Minami!

00:07:57.370 --> 00:07:58.820
Okay, Minami, you were too simple-minded, so-

00:07:58.820 --> 00:08:01.080
Owowow! My head's gonna come off!

00:08:01.720 --> 00:08:03.680
That attack is pretty bland.

00:08:05.800 --> 00:08:08.060
But he was supposed to be the key part of our plan!

00:08:08.340 --> 00:08:11.620
He couldn't even ace an elementary school level test!

00:08:11.620 --> 00:08:14.170
You can't blame Sakamoto.

00:08:15.420 --> 00:08:19.720
I like this classroom so much... there's no problem!

00:08:20.920 --> 00:08:23.200
Yeah, she definitely has a crush on Yuuji...

00:08:23.200 --> 00:08:27.570
<i>Because you can sit anywhere you want in this class...</i>

00:08:27.990 --> 00:08:30.420
Ding! Dong! Ding! Dong!

00:08:30.420 --> 00:08:32.740
Let's do this, people!

00:08:33.190 --> 00:08:34.440
Sit down, everyon-

00:08:34.440 --> 00:08:35.570
Oh, you're all seated.

00:08:37.520 --> 00:08:38.750
Why are you here, Mr. Nishimura?

00:08:39.130 --> 00:08:43.700
I'm here to help you guys improve your grades, since you're all retarded.

00:08:43.700 --> 00:08:49.590
From now on, I, the detention master, will be taking Mr. Fukuhara's place as your homeroom teacher!

00:08:49.590 --> 00:08:50.550
WHAT THE!?

00:08:50.550 --> 00:08:53.680
And I'll be doing the narration from now on.

00:08:53.680 --> 00:08:54.920
WHAT THE!?

00:08:54.920 --> 00:08:56.390
Ironman's gonna become our homeroom teacher!?

00:08:56.710 --> 00:08:59.260
Get ready for some hardcore teaching, kiddos!

00:09:04.090 --> 00:09:07.180
We're going to have to take supplemental
lessons from that demon literally every day.

00:09:07.180 --> 00:09:08.380
Yeah.

00:09:08.380 --> 00:09:10.250
I wonder if there's a way out of this.

00:09:10.250 --> 00:09:13.960
Oh yeah! Why don't we just start another ESB and win it this time?

00:09:13.960 --> 00:09:15.590
We can't.

00:09:15.590 --> 00:09:16.150
Why?

00:09:16.490 --> 00:09:20.330
The rules state that a class that has lost an ESB cannot declare another one for three months.

00:09:20.330 --> 00:09:20.920
Three-

00:09:21.080 --> 00:09:23.670
Don't worry, they'll fly by in no time.

00:09:24.130 --> 00:09:26.350
I'll use this time to think up new strategies.

00:09:26.350 --> 00:09:28.460
Why am I so unlucky!?

00:09:29.370 --> 00:09:30.730
Every cloud has a silver lining.

00:09:31.800 --> 00:09:32.960
One for 500 yen.

00:09:33.370 --> 00:09:34.400
Yes! Holy shit! Hell yeah!

00:09:34.400 --> 00:09:35.980
Be sure to stop by again.
Yes! Holy shit! Hell yeah!

00:09:35.980 --> 00:09:36.780
Yes! Holy shit! Hell yeah!

00:09:36.780 --> 00:09:38.380
What about your food budget?

00:09:41.780 --> 00:09:43.310
What's got your goat?

00:09:43.780 --> 00:09:44.470
Akihisa Yoshii
Secret Photobook

00:09:44.470 --> 00:09:46.530
I'm a man of my word!

00:09:46.530 --> 00:09:47.400
You're a hero.

00:09:47.760 --> 00:09:52.270
I've decided that I'll only eat one cup of ramen a day until I receive next month's allowance!

00:09:52.270 --> 00:09:55.520
Aren't you forgetting something?

00:09:57.090 --> 00:09:58.870
There you are!

00:09:58.870 --> 00:10:03.020
Hey, Aki! Where should we meet up this weekend?

00:10:03.020 --> 00:10:04.610
Meet up?

00:10:04.870 --> 00:10:08.530
Don't tell me you forgot about your promise to treat me to crepes!

00:10:09.410 --> 00:10:12.710
Wait just a second... I thought we finished that up yesterday?

00:10:12.710 --> 00:10:15.140
Yesterday is yesterday. A promise is a promise.

00:10:15.380 --> 00:10:17.610
May I come along?

00:10:18.430 --> 00:10:19.050
You too!?

00:10:19.190 --> 00:10:22.890
Actually, there's a movie I want to watch with you...

00:10:23.890 --> 00:10:26.340
My budget!

00:10:36.190 --> 00:10:38.390
Hello, this is your new narrator. It's the weekend.

00:10:39.770 --> 00:10:42.420
The ramen craftsman wakes up early.

00:10:43.980 --> 00:10:46.430
Okay, that one's for dinner, and- damn!

00:10:46.880 --> 00:10:49.710
Split it in half and eat one half...

00:10:49.710 --> 00:10:52.250
Cut the other half in half and eat half of that...

00:10:52.890 --> 00:10:57.090
If I just keep doing this...

00:10:57.090 --> 00:11:00.310
One cup of ramen will last me for all eternity!

00:11:00.310 --> 00:11:02.790
I think I'm a 21st century Einstein.

00:11:03.260 --> 00:11:05.450
He's enjoying his life in more ways than one.

00:11:07.400 --> 00:11:11.870
Still, though, I can't waste money...

00:11:14.050 --> 00:11:16.070
Hang on! If you think about it...

00:11:16.520 --> 00:11:20.500
Eating crepes and going to movies with girls...

00:11:20.500 --> 00:11:22.030
Wouldn't you call that a date?

00:11:23.430 --> 00:11:27.090
Yeah, that's what it is! It's not punishment at all!

00:11:27.090 --> 00:11:30.830
Well, that completely justifies spending all this money!

00:11:32.680 --> 00:11:33.660
Himeji!

00:11:38.650 --> 00:11:39.310
That's...

00:11:42.020 --> 00:11:44.940
I take that back. This is definitely a form of punishment.

00:11:44.940 --> 00:11:46.740
Why are you just standing there, Aki?

00:11:51.250 --> 00:11:53.960
I've fallen prey to life's absurdities.

00:11:53.960 --> 00:11:55.370
Yoshii!

00:11:55.370 --> 00:11:56.820
Morning, Mizuki.

00:11:56.820 --> 00:11:58.420
You're looking cute today.

00:11:58.420 --> 00:11:59.950
Thank you.

00:11:59.950 --> 00:12:03.660
But I spent so much time picking this out that I was almost late...

00:12:03.660 --> 00:12:06.820
Yeah, I couldn't figure out what to wear either.

00:12:06.820 --> 00:12:08.890
I'm so lucky that this blouse from last year still fits!

00:12:10.010 --> 00:12:11.800
In other words, your development has ceased...

00:12:11.800 --> 00:12:14.830
And my knee joints are being forcefully twisted.

00:12:14.830 --> 00:12:15.480
Ow! I didn't even say anything yet!

00:12:15.480 --> 00:12:17.560
Scorpion Hold!!
Ow! I didn't even say anything yet!

00:12:17.560 --> 00:12:20.760
