00:12:20.760 --> 00:12:22.160
Tap out!

00:12:22.610 --> 00:12:24.900
A-a-almost...!

00:12:24.900 --> 00:12:26.900
Why the hell are you here, Voyeur?

00:12:26.900 --> 00:12:27.560
Voluntary training.

00:12:28.050 --> 00:12:30.220
Yoshii, what do you want to watch?

00:12:30.220 --> 00:12:31.770
You get to choose today.

00:12:31.770 --> 00:12:32.360
Me?

00:12:32.960 --> 00:12:34.530
Well, they all cost the same...

00:12:35.150 --> 00:12:37.490
so I guess a longer one would mean more bang for my buck.

00:12:37.490 --> 00:12:39.220
Yuuji, what do you want to watch?

00:12:40.130 --> 00:12:44.050
Will my wish ever be granted?

00:12:44.050 --> 00:12:45.630
We'll be watching War and Peace, theatrical edition.

00:12:45.630 --> 00:12:47.890
Give me a break... That runs for seven hours, four minutes!

00:12:47.890 --> 00:12:48.790
Twice.

00:12:48.790 --> 00:12:50.960
There's no way in hell I can sit still for fourteen hours and eight minutes!

00:12:51.310 --> 00:12:53.830
If you get bored, you can sleep on my shoulder.

00:12:54.400 --> 00:12:55.570
Sleep!? More like a coma!

00:12:55.570 --> 00:12:57.690
It doesn't matter as long as we're together.

00:12:57.690 --> 00:12:58.560
No! No more!

00:12:58.560 --> 00:13:00.480
Two student tickets for two runs.

00:13:00.800 --> 00:13:04.400
Okay. One student ticket and another unconscious student ticket for two runs, correct?

00:13:04.400 --> 00:13:07.860
I envy people who can be so upfront about their feelings!

00:13:07.860 --> 00:13:09.220
I want to be like that...

00:13:09.220 --> 00:13:10.830
I changed my mind. Let's go for a shorter movie.

00:13:12.470 --> 00:13:14.250
You're not going to eat?

00:13:14.250 --> 00:13:15.240
It's really good.

00:13:15.240 --> 00:13:19.040
Well... I'm really picky, to be honest.

